flowchart LR
  S[Future components] --> EVT[Event classification]
  EVT --> REDACT[Redaction + minimization]
  REDACT --> MET[Metrics]
  REDACT --> LOG[Restricted logs]
  REDACT --> TRACE[Traces]
  REDACT --> AUDIT[Security audit]
  RETENTION[Retention policy] -. controls .-> LOG
  RETENTION -. controls .-> TRACE
  ACCESS[Role-based access] -. controls .-> AUDIT
  ALERT[Reviewed alerts] <-- MET
